*{{flagicon|Guernsey}} {{flag|Sark}} – Visa not required.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.gov.gg/ccm/home-department/customs-immigration/immigration-and-nationality-division/immigration/visa-requirements-for-the-bailiwick-of-guernsey.en |title=States of Guernsey: Immigration: Visa Requirements for the Bailiwick of Guernsey |access-date=2011-10-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20111011053936/http://www.gov.gg/ccm/home-department/customs-immigration/immigration-and-nationality-division/immigration/visa-requirements-for-the-bailiwick-of-guernsey.en |archive-date=2011-10-11 |url-status=dead}}</ref>
*{{flag|Isle of Man}} — Visa not required.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.gov.im/infocentre/faqs/import.gov?menuid=10167&page=cso%2Fimmigrationfaqs.xml |title=Immigration FAQ's - Isle of Man Public Services - |access-date=2014-05-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130217090924/http://www.gov.im/infocentre/faqs/import.gov?menuid=10167&page=cso%2Fimmigrationfaqs.xml |archive-date=2013-02-17 |url-status=dead }}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |url=https://www.gov.im/socialcare/security/useful.xml |title=Useful Definitions and Terms Explained - Isle of Man Department of Social Care |access-date=2014-05-05 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130618055715/http://www.gov.im/socialcare/security/useful.xml |archive-date=2013-06-18 |url-status=dead}}</ref>
