*{{flag|Jersey}} – Visa not required.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.gov.je/Working/WorkPermits/Pages/NeedWorkPermit.aspx|title = Government of Jersey}}</ref>
*{{flag|Kosovo}} — visa free for 90 days.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://mfa-ks.net/|title=Ministria e Punëve të Jashtme dhe Diasporës|website=MPJD &#124; MFAD}}</ref>
*{{flagicon|Russia}} [[Closed city#Russia|Closed cities and regions in Russia]] — special authorization required.<ref>{{Cite web |url=http://www.travel.state.gov/travel/cis_pa_tw/cis/cis_1006.html |title=Russian Federation |access-date=2014-11-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131203003453/http://www.travel.state.gov/travel/cis_pa_tw/cis/cis_1006.html#entry_requirements |archive-date=2013-12-03 |url-status=dead }}</ref>
