*{{flagicon|Sudan}} [[Darfur]] — Separate travel permit is required.<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://travel.state.gov/travel/cis_pa_tw/cis/cis_5525.html |title=Republic of South Sudan |access-date=2014-11-19 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131105150822/http://travel.state.gov/travel/cis_pa_tw/cis/cis_5525.html#entry_requirements |archive-date=2013-11-05 |url-status=dead }}</ref>

