*{{flagicon|China}} [[Hainan]] — Visa not required for 30 days with an invitation letter from an accredited local tour agency, or present a confirmed hotel reservation and return/onward ticket before immigration.<ref name="ReferenceA">{{Timatic|nationality=DK|destination=HK}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=China Focus: Hainan to offer visa-free access to tourists from 59 countries |url=http://www.xinhuanet.com/english/2018-04/18/c_137120441.htm |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180418152146/http://www.xinhuanet.com/english/2018-04/18/c_137120441.htm |url-status=dead |archive-date=18 April 2018 |publisher=Xinhua Net}}</ref>
*{{flag|Hong Kong}} — Visa not required for 90 days.<ref name="ReferenceA"/>
