329112747/http://manipurhub.com/news/manipur/protected-area-permit-requirement-lifted-from-manipur-for-one-year/ |archive-date=29 March 2019 |url-status=dead}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |url=http://lakshadweeptourism.nic.in/web9.htm |title=Tourism in Lakshadweep |access-date=2014-08-01 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140713171604/http://lakshadweeptourism.nic.in/web9.htm |archive-date=2014-07-13 |url-status=dead }}</ref>
