*{{flag|Taiwan}} — Visa not required for 90 days.<ref>http://www.timaticweb.com/cgi-bin/tim_website_client.cgi?SpecData=1&VISA=&page=visa&NA=DK&AR=00&PASSTYPES=PASS&DE=TW&user=KLMB2C&subuser=KLMB2C {{Dead link|date=March 2022}}</ref>
