*{{flagicon|United Nations}} [[UNDOF Zone]] and [[Ghajar]] — restricted zones.
*{{flagicon|Vietnam}} [[Phú Quốc]] — can visit without a visa for up to 30 days.<ref>{{Cite web |url=http://www.vietseatourist.vn/News/category1/news-57/No-visa-required-for-tourists-to-Phu-Quoc-on-short-stay.html |title=No visa required for tourists to Phu Quoc on short stay - Vietsea Tourist - Travel to Vietnam, Laos, Cambodia and Thailand &#124; Vietnam Travel Tours |access-date=8 May 2014 |archive-date=1 July 2017 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20170701095940/http://www.vietseatourist.vn/News/category1/news-57/No-visa-required-for-tourists-to-Phu-Quoc-on-short-stay.html |url-status=dead }}</ref>
