*{{flag|Saint Pierre and Miquelon}} — Visa not required.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/st-pierre-and-miquelon/entry-requirements|title = Entry requirements - St Pierre & Miquelon travel advice}}</ref>
*{{flag|Sint Maarten}} — Visa not required for 3 months.<ref>{{Timatic|nationality=DK|destination=SX}}</ref>
*{{flag|Turks and Caicos Islands}} — Visa not required for 90 days.<ref>{{Timatic|nationality=DK|destination=TC}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/turks-and-caicos-islands/entry-requirements|title=Entry requirements - Turks and Caicos Islands (British Overseas Territory) travel advice|website=GOV.UK}}</ref>
*{{flag|U.S. Virgin Islands}} — Visa not required under the [[Visa Waiver Program]], for 90 days on arrival from overseas for 2 years. [[Electronic System for Travel Authorization|ESTA]] required.<ref>{{Timatic|nationality=DK|destination=VI}}</ref>

